# value, name, version, path
# version is the schema version recorded inside taxa.sqlite by ETE3 (2 for both
# ete3 and ete4), not the version of the package that built the database.
# path is the directory holding taxa.sqlite (and its taxa.sqlite.traverse.pkl
# cache); the ETE3 taxonomy data manager fills this in for you.
#value	name	version	path
